---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'August 3, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Startup Sites PH"
  description="How Startup Sites PH collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <Nav />
  <main>
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="section-inner legal-hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow-warm"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>Privacy Policy</p>
        <h1 class="warm-title legal-title">Your privacy, plainly explained.</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-body section">
      <div class="section-inner legal-content warm-card">
        <p>
          Startup Sites PH ("we", "us", "our") builds websites and provides SEO
          and social media marketing services for businesses in the
          Philippines and beyond. This policy explains what information we
          collect through this website, how we use it, and the choices you
          have. We handle personal data in line with the Data Privacy Act of
          2012 (Republic Act No. 10173) of the Philippines.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you use this website, we may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Information you submit directly.</strong> When you fill out
            the contact form, we collect your name, email address, project
            type, and any details you choose to share about your project. This
            form is processed through Formspree, a third party form handling
            service.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Usage information.</strong> We use Google Analytics to
            understand how visitors use this site, such as which pages are
            viewed and how long visitors stay. This is collected in aggregate
            and is not used to personally identify you.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and quote requests</li>
          <li>Understand and improve how this website performs</li>
          <li>Communicate with you about a project you have asked about</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information to anyone.</p>

        <h2>Sharing your information</h2>
        <p>
          We only share personal information with the service providers that
          help us run this website and respond to inquiries, namely Formspree
          (contact form submissions) and Google Analytics (site usage data).
          We do not share your information with any other third party except
          where required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We keep contact form submissions for as long as reasonably needed to
          respond to your inquiry and, if you become a client, for the
          duration of our working relationship. You may request that we
          delete your information at any time by emailing us.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under the Data Privacy Act of 2012, you have the right to be
          informed, to access, to object, to correct, to erase or block, to
          data portability, to file a complaint, and to damages regarding your
          personal information. To exercise any of these rights, contact us
          using the details below.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses Google Analytics, which may set cookies in your
          browser to help us understand site traffic. You can opt out of
          Google Analytics tracking by adjusting your browser settings or
          using a browser extension that blocks analytics scripts.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted
          on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy or how we handle your
          information, email us at
          <a href="mailto:admin@startupsitesph.com">admin@startupsitesph.com</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="legal-disclaimer">
          This policy is provided for general informational purposes and is
          not a substitute for legal advice. If you need this policy reviewed
          for a specific legal or regulatory requirement, please consult a
          qualified lawyer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 8rem 0 2rem;
    background: var(--a-bg);
  }

  .legal-hero-inner {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--a-muted);
  }

  .legal-body {
    background: var(--a-bg);
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--a-ink);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display-warm);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--a-muted);
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--a-muted);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content strong {
    color: var(--a-ink);
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--a-coral);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-disclaimer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--a-ink) 10%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding-top: 6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
